%h1.control-legend{data: {toggle: "collapse", target: "#generate-prompt-container"}}
  Generate prompt

#generate-prompt-container.in.collapse
  %p
    If set, the level-specific data shown to students is generated by AI
    from this prompt at the time the client loads the level, overriding
    the static fields configured below. Leave blank to use the static
    configuration as-is.
  = f.text_area :generate_prompt, rows: 4, style: 'width: 100%', placeholder: 'Describe what this level should contain...'
